    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- Every invoice gets a per-organization `INV-000001`-style number at creation, shown in every invoice answer, and it is never reused.\n- Snapshot v3 stores the numbers and each organization's next number. Load reads v1–v3, numbering older invoices in (created_at, ID) order. Save is atomic (temp file in the same folder, then rename) and always writes v3.\n- `snapshot.Upgrade` backs up old files to `\u003cpath\u003e.v\u003cN\u003e.bak` and rewrites them as v3. Versions newer than 3 fail with `ErrUnsupportedVersion` in both Load and Upgrade. Tests cover each of these, and `go build`, `go test` and `go vet` pass.",
